(P/'BRIEF.md').write_text('---\nworkflow: hyperframes\nflow: automation\nstoryboard: no\n---\nThe user explicitly requires the attached Part 1, Part 2 and Untitled video recordings as the main proof. Use 122 seconds of actual product footage in a 180-second film. Preserve source speed, original videos and prior editions. Use short sourced Africa-to-Zambia opening and current production approval proof. Label older demonstration recordings separately from the current fictional Zambia integration. Explicitly redact supplier tax identifiers. No invented action, national filing, human pilot or claimed savings. Rendering is authorised by the user’s no-stops instruction and continue message.\n')
(P/'docs/STORYBOARD.md').write_text('# Recorded product edition\n\n| Time | Picture | Purpose |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|0-20|Sourced Africa procurement share, Zambia officer task|Context|\n|20-45|Part 1: checklist, open document, AI check; explicit redactions|Actual supplier interaction|\n|45-72|Part 2: notice, issued criteria, matrix and comparison|Recorded officer workflow|\n|72-110|Part 2: consent, request, result and NOT EVIDENCED questions|Actual model flow; separate current model evidence is labelled|\n|110-134|Untitled video: committee panel, register-member form, attendance|Actual human workflow|\n|134-142|Part 2: evaluator sheets and consensus|Committee scoring authority|\n|142-170|Captured current production 401,403,pending and signed simulation|Prove server boundary|\n|170-180|Builder, source, product and pilot ask|Destination|\n\nNormal-speed extracts and all source ranges are in edit-plan.json. Cuts remove waiting; they do not imply a new product action.\n')
(P/'hyperframes.json').write_text(json.dumps({'paths':{'blocks':'compositions','components':'compositions/components','assets':'assets'},'media':{'autoProxy':True},'authoringSkill':'general-video'},indent=2)+'\n')
(P/'.gitignore').write_text('.hyperframes/\n*.mp4\nassets/*.mp4\nassets/*.wav\nassets/*.ffconcat\nreview/*.png\nreview/*.jpg\nrenders/\n')
